{"title":"1999 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/a/a2a184acb246194947d52cc70525041b392ce60e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{4 \\times 4 + 4}{2 \\times 2 - 2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"78\" height=\"40\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/2/f424125bbba4e34d20b759554005f45c6cb241e2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{ (A) }\\ 2 \\qquad\\text{ (B) }\\ 6 \\qquad\\text{ (C) }\\ 10 \\qquad\\text{ (D) }\\ 12 \\qquad\\text{ (E) }\\ 18$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"415\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/3/c/93c5742f07700112767989b5d1e0462bfb55ae9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{4 \\times 4 + 4}{2 \\times 2 - 2} = \\frac{16 + 4}{4 - 2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"155\" height=\"40\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/2/762e480c6e274dcad2bc1ce976e22ad3c7117050.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\frac{20}{2} = \\boxed {\\textbf {(C) } 10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"132\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\"